/tmp/
/.build/
/.stack-work/

#   Files generated by Stack.
#
#   Stack generates *.cabal and stack.yaml.lock files. These are, for good
#   reasons, normally recommended to be checked in.[1] However, given that
#   this is a project under heavy development and we want to be checking
#   builds as soon as possible against new versions of dependencies, we do
#   not do this here. As the project becomes more stable,  we can look at
#   either committing these or usig `stack sdist` to generate source
#   tarballs that include them.
#   [1]: https://academy.fpblock.com/blog/storing-generated-cabal-files/
/stack.yaml.lock
/*.cabal

#   XXX This is generated by Liquid Haskell, and should be under .build/,
#   but we don't know how to do that yet.
/src/.liquid/
